# Minecraft Version(s): 26.3
## Guide Merl takes to the skies
- **Fly in creative mode** and Merl floats along ahead of you, upright and with her map, instead of waiting on the ground
- **Rockets!** While you glide she holds a firework rocket instead of her compass, and when you fire one she fires one too, with a trail of sparks
- **She keeps up now:** elytra Merl matches your speed and stays ahead of you instead of trailing behind
- **No more flying sideways:** she faces the way she's flying and leans into turns like a real player
- **Sparkles are back:** the trail between you and Merl is made of white sparkles again, now mixed with pink ones (no more glass squares)
